msgid "Hi, Kiryu-san! How are you doing? I'm just great, myself!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "92"
msgid "Oh! I have some special advice for you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"From my experience as a boxer, I know the crowd loves it\r\n"
"when you knock your opponent down."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"If somebody as strong as you was just thrown down, he'd\r\n"
"lose popularity with the crowd pretty fast."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"So don't succumb to any simple throws, or the audience will\r\n"
"lose all interest in you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "140"
msgid "I'll let you know if I remember any other good tips."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
